      "description": "Melissa Global Address API for CASS-certified address validation.\n\nKey fields in response:\n- Results: Validation result codes (AV11=verified, AV14=corrected, AE=error)\n- AddressType: Residential/Commercial indicator (RDI equivalent)\n- FormattedAddress: Standardized full address\n- MelissaAddressKey: Unique identifier for address lookups\n\nDocumentation: https://docs.melissa.com/cloud-api/global-address/global-address-index.html"
